sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as 用户协程
    participant W as CoroAbstractSocket CSC_AWAIT
    participant A as Awaitable CSC_AWAIT
    participant CH as FiberChannel CSC_DETAIL
    participant Sk as QAbstractSocket

    U->>W: coro(sock).readAll()
    W->>A: 建 Awaitable，取 channel()
    W->>Sk: connect(readyRead → ch.push(sock.readAll()))
    W->>Sk: connect(disconnected/destroyed → ch.close())
    alt 建连时已有缓冲数据
        W->>CH: 立即 push（规避 check-then-wait 竞态）
    end
    W-->>U: 返回 shared_ptr<Awaitable>
    U->>A: generate(shared_ptr) → 建 Generator（强持有 Awaitable）
    loop 每轮迭代
        U->>A: next() → CH.pop()（无数据则让出）
        Sk-->>CH: readyRead → push(数据块)
        CH-->>U: yield QByteArray
    end
    Sk-->>CH: disconnected → close()
    CH-->>U: pop 得关闭 → 迭代结束
    U->>A: close 或最终析构 → guard exactly-once disconnect